  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OhmsLaw.InteractionGate
  m_Time: 40.914603281021115
  gateId: S05_Drift
  description: "MCQ (graded): Which way are the free electrons drifting now? A. From
    the \u2212 end toward the + end (correct) \xB7 B. From the + end toward the \u2212
    end \xB7 C. Every which way, with no overall direction (partly right). Hint +
    retry; LearnerSession ElectronDrift"
